{"height": 16, "weight": 811, "base_experience": 179, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-attack", "value": 2}], "genus": "Illusion Fox Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["ground"], "gender_rate": 1, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ゾロアーク"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Zoroark"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "조로아크"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "索羅亞克"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Zoroark"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Zoroark"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Zoroark"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Zoroark"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ゾロアーク"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "索罗亚克"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Zoroark"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["black", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "Bonds between these Pokémon are very strong. It protects the safety of its pack by tricking its opponents."}, {"versions": ["white", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "Each has the ability to fool a large group of people simultaneously. They protect their lair with illusory scenery."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2"], "text": "Stories say those who tried to catch Zoroark were trapped in an illusion and punished."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "It doesn’t just transform itself—it also has the power to make hundreds of people see its illusions."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "If it thinks humans are going to discover its den, Zoroark shows them visions that make them wander around in the woods."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "This Pokémon cares deeply about others of its kind, and it will conjure terrifying illusions to keep its den and pack safe."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "Seeking to ease the burden of their solitude, lonely Trainers tell Zoroark to show illusions to them."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "With its disheveled white fur, it looks like an embodiment of death. Heedless of its own safety, Zoroark attacks its nemeses with a bi